-- Verified source: user supplied exact AQA 7132 v2.0 and 7182 v1.4 PDFs (REFERENCE_ONLY).
-- Exact PR #834 content at A3-reviewed head 675fdc8c53a224fe8fa9a81079b57b15dafef7af; six A3 PASS/PASS identities.
